    "detailed_description": "AutoDepth uses AI based depth map generation to give any image a new lease on life.<br>Using AutoDepth Image Viewer, view your favorite photos/artworks in a whole new dimension from the safety of your personal computer!<br>With a simple user interface that can be used with a mix of VR and non-VR devices, you can create a playlist of your images to browse as they're automatically stretched into 3D behind the scenes.<br>Take the experience even further with a set of interactive tools that allow you to engage with the imagery in unique ways you won't find anywhere else.<br>AutoDepth utilizes a custom shader to raymarch the depth map and view images in crispy 3D quality and apply fun effects.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> View Any Image In 3D Automatically<br></li><li> Custom Image Playlists<br></li><li> Intuitive UI with ToolTips<br></li><li> Usable in VR and Non-VR<br></li><li> Export: (3D model, depth maps, side-by-side depth maps)<br></li><li> Persistent individual viewing settings so you can curate how each image should look<br></li><li> Mouse support so you don't need to get out your VR controllers just to look at some images.<br></li><li> Force Push to Manipulate Image Depth<br></li><li> <i>goo mode</i></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "AutoDepth uses AI based depth map generation to give any image a new lease on life.<br>Using AutoDepth Image Viewer, view your favorite photos/artworks in a whole new dimension from the safety of your personal computer!<br>With a simple user interface that can be used with a mix of VR and non-VR devices, you can create a playlist of your images to browse as they're automatically stretched into 3D behind the scenes.<br>Take the experience even further with a set of interactive tools that allow you to engage with the imagery in unique ways you won't find anywhere else.<br>AutoDepth utilizes a custom shader to raymarch the depth map and view images in crispy 3D quality and apply fun effects.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> View Any Image In 3D Automatically<br></li><li> Custom Image Playlists<br></li><li> Intuitive UI with ToolTips<br></li><li> Usable in VR and Non-VR<br></li><li> Export: (3D model, depth maps, side-by-side depth maps)<br></li><li> Persistent individual viewing settings so you can curate how each image should look<br></li><li> Mouse support so you don't need to get out your VR controllers just to look at some images.<br></li><li> Force Push to Manipulate Image Depth<br></li><li> <i>goo mode</i></li></ul>",
